      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-02-2019-june/q12",
      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\"><li>Prove<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\cos 3\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}+\\frac{\\sin 3\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}\\equiv 2\\cot 2\\theta\\qquad \\theta\\neq(90n)^\\circ,\\ n\\in\\mathbb Z\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence solve, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"90^\\circ&lt;\\theta&lt;180^\\circ\"></span>, the equation<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\cos 3\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}+\\frac{\\sin 3\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}=4\" data-display=\"true\"></div>giving any solutions to one decimal place. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
